app.vulkan.no_loader = schist: akulasilayishi se-Vulkan kulesi isistimu, ngakho akulalutho okungadwetshwa ngalo.\n\nI-Schist idweba nge-Vulkan, njalo i-`libvulkan.so.1` ayifakwanga.\nKudingeka kokubili isilayishi lomshayeli:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-icd-loader vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install vulkan-loader mesa-vulkan-drivers\n
app.vulkan.override_missing = schist: umshayeli we-Vulkan okhonjwe yiseshini le kawukho.\n\nU-{var} usethiwe, njalo ukummisa *kungena esikhundleni* sokudinga\nkwesilayishi abashayeli, hatshi ukungezelela kukho. Ngakho amafayela la, angekhoyo,\nayiwo wodwa aluhlu lwabashayeli — njalo lonke uhlelo lwe-Vulkan kuseshini le\nkaluboni lamunye umshayeli, kungelani lokuthi bangaki abafakiweyo:\n\n{missing}\n    {var}={value}\n\nMkhombe kumanifesti ekhona — abashayeli abafakiweyo bafaka awabo ku-\n/usr/share/vulkan/icd.d — kumbe umsuse uyekele isilayishi sizidingele.\nIseshini emisa lokhu kusuka kufayela lokuhlela (u-`env =` we-Hyprland,\nifayela le-systemd environment.d, iphrofayili ye-shell) kumele ilungiswe khona,\nngemva kwalokho kudingeka ungene kutsha ukuze inguquko ifike kokusivele kusebenza.\n
app.vulkan.override_note = \nU-{var} usethwe waba ngu-{value}, njalo lokhu kungena esikhundleni sokudinga\nkwesilayishi: nxa kungekho manifesti phakathi kwawo eyalo umtshina, into yokuqala\nongayizama yikususa lokho kusetha.\n
app.vulkan.no_driver = schist: akulamshayeli we-Vulkan ofakiweyo, ngakho akulalutho okungadwetshwa kulo.\n\nI-Schist idweba nge-Vulkan. Isilayishi sifakiwe kodwa sithi akulamshayeli —\nakulalutho olubhalise umshayeli kuzo zombili indawo esidinga kuzo:\n\n{dirs}\n\nIsilayishi siza sodwa, sehlukene labashayeli, ngakho kuvame ukuba yiphakethe elilodwa\nelingafakwanga.\n\nFaka umshayeli we-GPU yalo umtshina:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n\nUmshayeli we-NVIDIA ongumnikazi ulewakhe (`nvidia-utils` ku-Arch,\n`nvidia-driver` ku-Debian). Kumtshina wokulingisa, kumbe lapho okungela\nmshayeli we-GPU ongafakwa khona, isidwebo sesofthiwe yiso esisebenzayo:\n`vulkan-swrast` ku-Arch, njalo siyingxenye ye-`mesa-vulkan-drivers` kwezinye indawo. Sisebenza kancane,\nkodwa siyaqalisa.\n{overridden}
app.vulkan.no_device = schist: umshayeli we-Vulkan ufakiwe kodwa kawuniki idivayisi okungadwetshwa kuyo.\n\nUmshayeli angabe engayisekeli i-GPU le, kumbe engenelisi ukufika kuyo —\nusebenzisa i-SSH, kumbe ngaphakathi kwesiqukathi, kuvame ukusilela i-/dev/dri.\nU-`vulkaninfo --summary` ubika lokho isilayishi esikubonayo.\n\nIsidwebo sesofthiwe sidweba kungela GPU, nxa kunjalo kulo umtshina:\n`vulkan-swrast` ku-Arch, siyingxenye ye-`mesa-vulkan-drivers`\nku-Debian le-Fedora.\n
app.vulkan.skip_hint = Ukuqalisa i-Schist loba kunjalo uyekele yehluleke ngendlela yayo, setha {var}=1.
